1
00:00:02,517 --> 00:00:06,076
1934. Curt Mast perfects a recipe.

2
00:00:06,217 --> 00:00:09,625
Fifty-six herbs, blossoms, roots and fruits.

3
00:00:09,667 --> 00:00:11,664
Which ones? Still a secret.

4
00:00:13,167 --> 00:00:15,947
Then it waits. A full year, in oak.

5
00:00:20,567 --> 00:00:23,376
In the seventies, it crosses an ocean.

6
00:00:24,517 --> 00:00:26,985
And America serves it ice cold.

7
00:00:30,817 --> 00:00:34,625
Around 1997… somebody has an idea.

8
00:00:34,667 --> 00:00:36,175
Nobody knows exactly who.

9
00:00:36,217 --> 00:00:38,055
Everybody knows the name.

10
00:00:50,517 --> 00:00:53,378
A year in oak. A second in glass.

11
00:00:57,467 --> 00:00:58,883
Jägermeister.

